- Performance analysis
- Stress validation
- Confirmation

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
PERFORMANCE CONSTRAINTS — LOCKED
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

- bcrypt SALT_ROUNDS = 10
- JWT expiration = 7d
- Body limit = 100kb
- JSON maxDepth = 7
- Registro limit = 20 / 15min
- Login limit = 15 / 5min
- Engajamento limit = 10 / 1min
- Leitura limit = 200 / 1min
- Health limit = 30 / min
- Cron cleanup hourly

Changing requires:
- Impact matrix
- Stress review
- Documentation update

