ATOMIC IMPLEMENTATION PROTOCOL — MANDATORY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Multi-layer or multi-component changes MUST be divided into Atomic Checkpoints.

The AI MUST:
1. Present phased execution plan.
2. Wait confirmation per checkpoint.
3. Avoid full-scope mutation in single step.

Failure = Governance Violation.

